    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Grade Schooler Living Alone",
        "jpn": "ひとり暮らしの小学生"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Rin Suzune is a nine-year-old girl who, due to her parents' deaths, lives alone and runs her family's restaurant by herself. Since she is a child, she lacks the proper knowledge to cook good food and manage a business, so her attempts to make money are unsuccessful. To make matters worse, she is bullied in school for being poor! But through it all, Rin remains resilient. Although her restaurant's food is not the greatest, local residents are drawn to the establishment, hoping to lend Rin a hand because of her sincere nature.",
        "jpn": "1980年代、一人暮らしの少女鈴根凛は、亡くなった実家のレストランを相続した。 すぐに、彼女の周りでいくつかの話が起こりました。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "The Girl Living Alone",
        "Hitorigurashi no Shougakusei"
    ],
